0..71 Comment "// A site answering its role\'s row: the console from its authority, and"
72..106 Comment "// `store` by a module of its own."
107..109 Comment "//"
110..187 Comment "// A site\'s offer lives in its own file, so the program never names the place"
188..206 Comment "// that serves it."
207..209 Comment "//"
210..285 Comment "// Each label is bound to a model module the file declares. The module need"
286..361 Comment "// not model the program\'s `Store`. It must hold each of its members at the"
362..428 Comment "// sorts the row fixes, and this one models the site\'s own `Kept`."
429..431 Comment "//"
